WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.420
I'm Russ Michaels with Tercet Law.

2
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:12.260
When people hear the word legacy, they think about money, the house, the

3
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.060
accounts, who gets what.

4
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.520
That matters, but in my experience, it's not what families remember.

5
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:24.660
They remember whether things were clear, whether they knew what you wanted,

6
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.440
whether they spent that time together or just trying to figure it out.

7
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.880
A good plan is a gift.

8
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.180
It says, I thought about you.

9
00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.600
I took care of this, so you don't have to.

10
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:43.600
It can carry more than property, a letter to your kids, the values you want

11
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.920
passed down, the family land kept in the family, a cause you care about.

12
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:54.040
I've spent my career in service, leading organizations that take care of

13
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:54.440
people.

14
00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:59.560
And I've learned that the people who plan ahead give their families something

15
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.200
money can't buy, peace of mind.

16
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.360
So let's talk about what you own, yes, but let's start with who you love.

17
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.680
There's a door here for you.

18
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:13.880
Click the link below and let's build something that lasts.

